    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Quantify comb-building behaviours and architectures across bumblebees, stingless bees, and honeybees, then reconstruct ancestral transitions on a bee phylogeny. Ordered small changes toward regular comb support the claim.";
